  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The tool runs an iterative loop: each iteration orients from specs, picks one task, implements and tests it, verifies criteria, commits and pushes, then repeats until a DONE marker appears. The product is driven by shell scripts: ralph-loop.sh (default build mode) and an optional 'plan' mode invoked as ralph-loop.sh plan, with matching PowerShell .ps1 variants.",
